# Keep shell scripts (and other Linux-side files) LF, even when checked out on
# Windows with core.autocrlf=true. CRLF endings break `bash` inside the
# container (e.g. `set -euo pipefail\r` -> "invalid option name").
*.sh            text eol=lf
.devcontainer/* text eol=lf
Dockerfile*     text eol=lf
*.bash          text eol=lf
*.yml           text eol=lf
*.yaml          text eol=lf
